  "ingredients": [
    "2.25 cups whole milk",
    "2.25 cups water",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "1 cup quick-cooking grits",
    "1 (8 ounce) package processed cheese (such as Velveeta®), cubed",
    "0.5 pound sharp Cheddar cheese, cubed",
    "0.25 cup butter",
    "0.125 teaspoon garlic powder",
    "2 eggs, beaten"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Butter a 9x12-inch baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-c5X4qjobXlpNM-xoAy7Yzho0ys=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/231528-cheese-grits-casserole-VAT-step-01-9b24f929a37c4a3cb0e50337467a2845.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/231528/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring milk, water, and salt to a boil in a large saucepan; gradually sprinkle grits into the boiling liquid, stirring to combine. Cook until thickened, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mzDOB0pdS-lY2zgq9decG4LiT64=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/231528-cheese-grits-casserole-VAT-step-02-0b7bc5afbb524f6b81b4f90beee955c9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/231528/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir processed cheese, sharp Cheddar cheese, butter, and garlic powder into grits, stirring until cheese has melted.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/CY3Yzo_92dolrTlAGL028Ihx-y8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/231528-cheese-grits-casserole-VAT-step-03-334372a201d44115a60057500a4fe448.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/231528/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Let the mixture stand until cooled, about 15 minutes. Stir beaten eggs into grits; transfer to prepared baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jH1mi9P833Qroub8uxsD_z2NoS0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/231528-cheese-grits-casserole-VAT-step-04-9c8ba60744b04793beeace32bb0e4486.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/231528/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until the top is lightly golden brown and the grits are set, about 45 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/WucVrN3P31srRp9zlt0IMAVjWuQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/231528-cheese-grits-casserole-VAT-step-05-438461d7fe8844b9b75081330f19275b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/231528/step_05.webp"
    }
  ],
